  "methods": {
    "oneshot": "greedy, 32 units centred uniform grid",
    "elim": "sequential: mask found spans (dilated max(1s,10%)) and spend 32 units uniformly on the unmasked timeline; accept new spans >=50% outside mask, IoU<.3 with found, <=80% of unmasked length; stop when nothing accepted; <=3 extra calls",
